  "description": "They called him the Calamity Sword—a rogue Mudang elder feared by the arrogant and revered by the common folk. Jeong-Hyun, once the scourge of corrupt warriors, now lives a quieter life after the death of his old friend, Mu-Baek Son, the Heavenly Demon and ruler of the Temple of the Radiant Heaven. Entrusted with Mu-Baek’s granddaughter, So-Jin, Jeong-Hyun gains more than just a ward—he gains a second chance at life and purpose.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
